    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dungeon Ward</strong> is a mix of <strong>classic grid-based dungeon crawler</strong> and fast-paced <strong>action RPG</strong>, offering intense <strong>real-time combat</strong>, strategic movement, and character progression. Developed by solo indie developer, Dungeon Ward reignites the thrill of 90s dungeon crawling with heart-pounding combat at its core.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/af59fd9c57465f5347fb13514edb4fbf.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/af59fd9c57465f5347fb13514edb4fbf.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/af59fd9c57465f5347fb13514edb4fbf.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose between three distinct classes</h2><strong>Warden</strong>: A sturdy melee fighter armed with both defensive and offensive abilities.<br><strong>Ranger</strong>: Specializes in ranged combat but can also shapeshift into a werewolf for devastating close-quarters attacks.<br><strong>Mage</strong>: A master of elemental magic, wielding fireballs, lightning, and other powerful spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/6fdaaf0ef46b3bd527cf8361b1b1c603.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/6fdaaf0ef46b3bd527cf8361b1b1c603.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/6fdaaf0ef46b3bd527cf8361b1b1c603.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn special skills and talents</h2>Invest in skill trees and talent points to unlock powerful abilities and passives, customizing your character's build to fit your playstyle. Whether you prefer raw strength, deadly precision, or magical prowess, the choice is yours.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/3a411234e32e374b037788beb67f14e1.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/3a411234e32e374b037788beb67f14e1.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/3a411234e32e374b037788beb67f14e1.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Challenging Boss Fights</h2>Face off against epic bosses, each featuring unique mechanics that demand strategy and quick reflexes. Timing, positioning, and mastery of your class will be key to success.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/9d3f41d0d53ed1ed79edb579103b17e3.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/9d3f41d0d53ed1ed79edb579103b17e3.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/9d3f41d0d53ed1ed79edb579103b17e3.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Epic Loot</h2>Collect powerful loot as you progress through dungeons, with equipment and items that cater to your class and build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/be475f08e8d0e02fc32d4261c1f1d6c3.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/be475f08e8d0e02fc32d4261c1f1d6c3.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/be475f08e8d0e02fc32d4261c1f1d6c3.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to dive into a fresh take on classic dungeon crawling?</h2>Step into Dungeon Ward today, hone your skills, and conquer dangerous dungeons filled with deadly enemies. Can you survive the challenges and rise as a hero?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/2d473040914756823f0474d96fa02fa6.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/2d473040914756823f0474d96fa02fa6.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/2d473040914756823f0474d96fa02fa6.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add <strong>Dungeon Ward</strong> to your <strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> and get ready for an epic adventure!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Dungeon Ward</strong> is a mix of <strong>classic grid-based dungeon crawler</strong> and fast-paced <strong>action RPG</strong>, offering intense <strong>real-time combat</strong>, strategic movement, and character progression. Developed by solo indie developer, Dungeon Ward reignites the thrill of 90s dungeon crawling with heart-pounding combat at its core.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/af59fd9c57465f5347fb13514edb4fbf.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/af59fd9c57465f5347fb13514edb4fbf.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/af59fd9c57465f5347fb13514edb4fbf.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose between three distinct classes</h2><strong>Warden</strong>: A sturdy melee fighter armed with both defensive and offensive abilities.<br><strong>Ranger</strong>: Specializes in ranged combat but can also shapeshift into a werewolf for devastating close-quarters attacks.<br><strong>Mage</strong>: A master of elemental magic, wielding fireballs, lightning, and other powerful spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/6fdaaf0ef46b3bd527cf8361b1b1c603.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/6fdaaf0ef46b3bd527cf8361b1b1c603.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/6fdaaf0ef46b3bd527cf8361b1b1