an class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/be475f08e8d0e02fc32d4261c1f1d6c3.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/be475f08e8d0e02fc32d4261c1f1d6c3.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/be475f08e8d0e02fc32d4261c1f1d6c3.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to dive into a fresh take on classic dungeon crawling?</h2>Step into Dungeon Ward today, hone your skills, and conquer dangerous dungeons filled with deadly enemies. Can you survive the challenges and rise as a hero?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/2d473040914756823f0474d96fa02fa6.poster.avif?t=1755338271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/2d473040914756823f0474d96fa02fa6.webm?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220150/extras/2d473040914756823f0474d96fa02fa6.mp4?t=1755338271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add <strong>Dungeon Ward</strong> to your <strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> and get ready for an epic adventure!</h2>",
